<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποξηραίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dry up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀρχαῖον ῥέεθρον-ξηρῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.99
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be dried up,</i> of rivers, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποξηρανθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.75
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεξηρασμένου τοῦ . .
			ῥεέθρου</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				186
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.109
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>dry completely,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ναῦς</span>
			<i>lay</i> them <i>up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.12
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεξηραμμένα κρεᾴδια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					124.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.11.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
